;; Browser build for Boutique Stack.
;;
;; Source paths point at the west checkouts (`orgs/<org>/<repo>`) rather than
;; at Maven/git coordinates: this game is staged inside the superproject
;; (ADR-2608620000), so the engine it draws through is the one the manifest
;; pins, and a `west update` moves both together.
;;
;; One build, one document, one mount — ADR-2608080100.
{:source-paths
 ["src"
  "../src"
  "../resources"
  "../../common/src"
  "../../../../../orgs/kotoba-lang/cartpole-math/src"
